}, {"contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous pouvez utiliser quand vous rencontrez une personne.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le nom de famille", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un mot pour s'identifier", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Mon nom de famille est Monge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "merci", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une expression de remerciement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je vais bien, merci.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le professeur", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une personne qui enseigne", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : M. Lumi\u00e8re est un excellent professeur.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nouveau, nouvelle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une personne qui vient d'arriver", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle est nouvelle dans la classe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "d\u00e9sol\u00e9, d\u00e9sol\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une excuse quand vous faites une erreur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je suis d\u00e9sol\u00e9e, je ne me souviens plus</br>de ton pr\u00e9nom !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Se pr\u00e9senter et \u00e9changer des informations personnelles", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Voici comment vous vous pr\u00e9sentez et pr\u00e9sentez une autre personne.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte </span>: <span class=\"italic\">Salut, je m'appelle Charlotte ! Comment tu t'appelles ?</span></br><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : <span class=\"italic\">Je m'appelle Pierre. Enchant\u00e9 !</span> </br> </br>  <span class=\"strong\">Pierre </span>: <span class=\"italic\">Voici Charlotte. Elle est nouvelle.</span></br><span class=\"strong\">M. Lumi\u00e8re</span> : <span class=\"italic\">Bonjour, Charlotte. C'est un plaisir de faire votre connaissance.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"4\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Je me pr\u00e9sente</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Demander des informations personnelles</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Pr\u00e9senter une autre personne</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">R\u00e9ponse</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"- Je m'appelle...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"- Comment vous appelez-vous ?</br>- Quel est votre pr\u00e9nom ?</br>- Quel est votre nom de famille ?</br>- Quel \u00e2ge avez-vous&#x202F;?</br> - Quel \u00e2ge as-tu ?</br> - Que fais-tu dans la vie ?</br> - Qu'est-ce que vous faites dans la vie ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"- Voici...</br>- Je vous pr\u00e9sente...</br>- Je te pr\u00e9sente...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"- Enchant\u00e9(e) !</br>- Je suis enchant\u00e9(e)/ravi(e) de faire ta connaissance.</br>- C'est un plaisir de faire votre connaissance.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Compl\u00e9tez le tableau. \u00c9crivez d'autres informations telles que : D'o\u00f9-venez-vous ? O\u00f9 habitez-vous ?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez le nom dans le tableau.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez les salutations que vous utilisez.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez d'autres informations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":6,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nom&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nationalit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Lieu de r\u00e9sidence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Profession\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Salutation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"4\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"5\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Je demande le nom des autres personnes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'utilise des formes de politesse.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je pose des questions aux autres.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "", "type": "p"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "400", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">1\u00e8re conversation</span>"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "400", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Bonjour, je m'appelle Charlotte. Comment tu t'appelles ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Je m'appelle Pierre. Enchant\u00e9 ! Comment \u00e7a va ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte </span>: \u00c7a va, merci. Tu t'appelles Paul, c'est \u00e7a ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre </span>: Non, c'est Pierre."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "11500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Oh, d\u00e9sol\u00e9e !  Est-ce la classe de M. Lumi\u00e8re ? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Oui, c'est ici m\u00eame. \u00cates-vous nouvelle ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Oui. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Il enseigne bien. Oh, le voil\u00e0 !<br/> <br/>"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "22500", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">2\u00e8me conversation <span>"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "22500", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Bonjour M. Lumi\u00e8re.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">M. Lumi\u00e8re</span> : Ah bonjour, comment allez-vous ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img06.jpg", "time": "26000", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Je vais tr\u00e8s bien, merci.  Vous pouvez m'appeller Pierre.  Voici Charlotte, elle est nouvelle.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">M. Lumi\u00e8re</span> :  Bonjour, Charlotte. Enchant\u00e9. C'est un plaisir de faire votre connaissance et d'\u00eatre votre professeur. Quel est votre nom de famille ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img06.jpg", "time": "40000", "id": 7, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Monge. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">M. Lumi\u00e8re</span> : Bienvenue en classe.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Merci, enchant\u00e9e ! C'est un plaisir de faire votre connaissance M. Lumi\u00e8re."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "47000", "id": 8, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">M. Lumi\u00e8re</span> : Commen\u00e7ons !"}], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data"